  "details": "The current Viewable Banned User limit is only 7500. There is thousands of groups with thousands of members that dedicate themselves to crashing, doxing and just ruining the fun for others in the game. \n\nI have banned tons of these groups from my group instances using an api script that I've made that's automated to skim through public group member lists and ban them from my group. My script also skims through my groups ban list and instead of attempting to ban each one individually it takes note of who has already been banned and skips those members. This limit puts a hard hindrance on my script as it slows the process down enormously. This limit being increased is a must if you all at VRChat want group owners to continue to try and keep their group instances a safe place from malicious users trying to ruin the fun and everyones good time.",
